  "details": "First of all whenever I open the Settings tab it's always scrolled to the bottom.\nThe \"UI Elements\" section behaves correctly. It collapses and expands correctly.\nThe \"Avatar Interactions\" tab collapses correctly but when I expand it the entire Settings tab scrolls to the bottom.\nThe \"Tracking and IK\" section doesn't collapse at all. When clicking the button again (to what would expand if it collapsed in the first place) then it scrolls the Settings tab to the bottom.\n\"Accessibility\" and \"Safety\" sections are broken just like the \"Avatar Interactions\" section.\nThe \"Chatbox\" section seems to work fine just like the \"UI Elements\" section.",
